    <string name="service_test_set_clock" volt:screen="Scheduled charging test result" volt:purpose="message part" volt:safety="charge"
        volt:dnt="Volt">" Volt set the scooter\'s clock right before this test, so the scooter may not be keeping the time it\'s given. Until that\'s solved, a smart plug is a safer timer. Report an issue with diagnostics so we can look into it."</string>
    <string name="service_test_limit" volt:screen="Scheduled charging test result" volt:purpose="message" volt:safety="charge">The battery reached its charge limit during the test, so it couldn\'t tell. Test again further below the limit.</string>
    <string name="service_test_interrupted" volt:screen="Scheduled charging test result" volt:purpose="message" volt:safety="charge">The test was interrupted. Check that charging resumed. If it didn\'t, turn Scheduled charging off.</string>
